# Lifecycle contract

## Setup

```sh
# Should run setup in order
node step.cjs setup

# Should run the next setup unless interrupted
node step.cjs setup-next
```

## Test

```sh
# Should preserve process lifecycle and retry metadata
node step.cjs test

# Should run the next test unless interrupted
node step.cjs next
```

## Cleanup

```sh
# Should clean up after the test lifecycle
node step.cjs cleanup

# Should run the next cleanup unless cleanup is interrupted
node step.cjs cleanup-next
```
